                <mxCell id="pirTfQWx5-7ccy771wun-92" parent="44" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;3. Error page: -&amp;nbsp; can be added at specific route level and at global level&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Error.tsx page in next.js, receives two args: -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;error: - this err object contains&amp;nbsp;a digest hash, for the error that happens on the server(during SSR or in server Component) to into&amp;nbsp; server logs, rather than sending the sensitive errors to client&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;reset: - A function to try rendering that route segment again&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;the clild page error just bubble up to the parent so the error page in the parent folder will handle all its nested pages errors or we can create different error page for every nested page&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;The same error page can/will also handle the error in the &lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgba(168, 169, 170, 0.52) rgb(18, 19, 20); background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 102, 204));&quot;&gt;client component&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
